{"seq":2,"slug":"resource-modeling","title":"资源建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/rest-api-design/resource-modeling","wordCount":865,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"资源建模\">资源建模</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>资源建模是 REST API 设计的核心活动——它决定了 API 的结构、URL 体系和数据流向。资源不等于数据库表，它是<strong>面向使用场景的抽象</strong>。好的资源模型让 API 符合消费者的心智模型，而不是暴露系统内部的实现细节。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[业务领域] --&gt; B[识别核心资源]&#10;    B --&gt; C[定义资源关系]&#10;    C --&gt; D[设计 URL 层次]&#10;    D --&gt; E[确定表述格式]&#10;    E --&gt; F[验证使用场景]&#10;    F --&gt;|不满足| B&#10;    subgraph 迭代优化&#10;        B&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;        E&#10;        F&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[业务领域] --&gt; B[识别核心资源]\n    B --&gt; C[定义资源关系]\n    C --&gt; D[设计 URL 层次]\n    D --&gt; E[确定表述格式]\n    E --&gt; F[验证使用场景]\n    F --&gt;|不满足| B\n    subgraph 迭代优化\n        B\n        C\n        D\n        E\n        F\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>建模维度</th>\n<th>数据库驱动</th>\n<th>领域驱动</th>\n<th>使用场景驱动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>出发点</td>\n<td>表结构</td>\n<td>聚合根</td>\n<td>客户端需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源粒度</td>\n<td>一表一资源</td>\n<td>一聚合一资源</td>\n<td>按场景组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优势</td>\n<td>简单直接</td>\n<td>业务语义清晰</td>\n<td>客户端体验好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>劣势</td>\n<td>暴露内部实现</td>\n<td>可能过度抽象</td>\n<td>维护成本高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用阶段</td>\n<td>内部工具 API</td>\n<td>领域复杂系统</td>\n<td>公开 API</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"资源粒度设计\">资源粒度设计</h2><p>资源粒度是最关键的设计决策之一。太细导致 N+1 请求问题，太粗导致过度获取（over-fetching）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface User {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  email: string;&#10;  avatar: string;&#10;  createdAt: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface UserProfile {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  avatar: string;&#10;  bio: string;&#10;  socialLinks: SocialLink[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface UserSettings {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  theme: &#39;light&#39; | &#39;dark&#39; | &#39;auto&#39;;&#10;  language: string;&#10;  notifications: NotificationPreference[];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  avatar</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  createdAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  avatar</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  bio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  socialLinks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SocialLink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserSettings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  theme</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'light'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'dark'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'auto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  language</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  notifications</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NotificationPreference</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>将 User 拆分为三个子资源是粒度设计的经典案例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"GET /users/123              → 基础信息（列表场景）&#10;GET /users/123/profile      → 详细档案（个人页场景）&#10;GET /users/123/settings     → 配置偏好（设置页场景）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>GET /users/123              → 基础信息（列表场景）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>GET /users/123/profile      → 详细档案（个人页场景）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>GET /users/123/settings     → 配置偏好（设置页场景）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种设计的好处是<strong>按需获取</strong>——列表页只请求轻量的基础信息，设置页只请求配置数据，避免了传输不需要的字段。</p>\n<p><strong>聚合资源</strong>（Aggregate Resource）是另一种常见模式——将多个相关资源组合成一个响应：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Dashboard {&#10;  user: UserSummary;&#10;  recentOrders: OrderSummary[];&#10;  notifications: Notification[];&#10;  stats: UserStats;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// GET /users/123/dashboard → 一次请求获取仪表盘需要的所有数据\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Dashboard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserSummary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  recentOrders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderSummary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  notifications</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Notification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  stats</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserStats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// GET /users/123/dashboard → 一次请求获取仪表盘需要的所有数据</span></span></code></pre></div><p>聚合资源在 BFF（Backend for Frontend）模式中特别常见——每个前端页面有对应的聚合接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关系与嵌套\">关系与嵌套</h2><p>资源间的关系通过 URL 嵌套和引用来表达。核心原则是<strong>嵌套表示强归属，引用表示弱关联</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"强归属（嵌套）&#10;GET /orders/456/items         订单的商品项（离开订单无意义）&#10;GET /posts/789/comments       文章的评论（属于文章）&#10;&#10;弱关联（引用）&#10;GET /users/123                 用户资源中包含 { &quot;teamId&quot;: &quot;team-42&quot; }&#10;GET /teams/42                  独立的团队资源\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>强归属（嵌套）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>GET /orders/456/items         订单的商品项（离开订单无意义）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>GET /posts/789/comments       文章的评论（属于文章）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>弱关联（引用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>GET /users/123                 用户资源中包含 { \"teamId\": \"team-42\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>GET /teams/42                  独立的团队资源</span></span></code></pre></div><p>嵌套的深度不应超过 2 层。超过 2 层说明资源模型需要重新审视：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ /users/123/orders/456/items/789/reviews&#10;✅ /order-items/789/reviews 或 /reviews?order_item_id=789\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ /users/123/orders/456/items/789/reviews</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ /order-items/789/reviews 或 /reviews?order_item_id=789</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ResourceRelation {&#10;  type: &#39;composition&#39; | &#39;aggregation&#39; | &#39;association&#39;;&#10;  expression: &#39;nested&#39; | &#39;reference&#39; | &#39;embedded&#39;;&#10;  example: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const relations: ResourceRelation[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;composition&#39;,&#10;    expression: &#39;nested&#39;,&#10;    example: &#39;/orders/456/items → 订单项从属于订单&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;aggregation&#39;,&#10;    expression: &#39;embedded&#39;,&#10;    example: &#39;订单响应中内嵌用户摘要&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;association&#39;,&#10;    expression: &#39;reference&#39;,&#10;    example: &#39;订单响应中包含 userId 引用&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResourceRelation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'composition'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'aggregation'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'association'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expression</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'nested'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'reference'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'embedded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  example</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> relations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResourceRelation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'composition'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expression: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'nested'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    example: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/orders/456/items → 订单项从属于订单'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'aggregation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expression: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'embedded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    example: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'订单响应中内嵌用户摘要'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'association'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expression: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reference'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    example: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'订单响应中包含 userId 引用'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>内嵌（Embedding）</strong> vs <strong>引用（Reference）</strong> 是关联资源的表述选择。内嵌减少请求数但增加响应体积；引用保持响应精简但可能导致 N+1。可以用 <code>?expand=author,tags</code> 参数让客户端按需选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集合操作设计\">集合操作设计</h2><p>集合资源（Collection）的设计需要覆盖过滤、排序、分页、搜索等操作。这些操作通过 Query String 表达，保持 URL 的资源语义不变。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CollectionParams {&#10;  page: number;&#10;  perPage: number;&#10;  sort: string;&#10;  order: &#39;asc&#39; | &#39;desc&#39;;&#10;  filter: Record&lt;string, string&gt;;&#10;  fields: string[];&#10;  search: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// GET /users?page=2&amp;per_page=20&amp;sort=created_at&amp;order=desc&amp;role=admin&amp;fields=id,name,email&#10;&#10;interface PaginatedResponse&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  data: T[];&#10;  meta: {&#10;    total: number;&#10;    page: number;&#10;    perPage: number;&#10;    totalPages: number;&#10;  };&#10;  links: {&#10;    self: string;&#10;    first: string;&#10;    prev: string | null;&#10;    next: string | null;&#10;    last: string;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CollectionParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  page</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  perPage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--s